    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48334" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοφάν-ια</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>festival at Delphi, at which the statues of
				Apollo and other gods were shown to the people</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.51
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.34
			</span></i>; at Chios, <i><span class="en">
