					<u>VA</u>
					4.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. θύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					11.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
